<!--
    Notification small icon: the app mark, as line art.

    Not the launcher icon. Since Android 5 the small icon is alpha-only -
    the system discards its colours and tints the silhouette - so a
    full-colour mipmap renders as a solid white blob. This is the same
    drawing (artwork/icon.svg), kept as strokes so the alpha channel is
    the line work itself.

    Paths are the two visible ones from icon.svg, carrying that file's
    combined group translation (13.906102 + 1.6866663, 66.354946 -
    45.872474). Scaled slightly about the centre so the mark doesn't run
    to the very edge of the 24dp box the status bar gives it.
-->
